 g out with us at Asheville's best karaoke night at The Burger Bar in the R
 iver Arts area.\n\nThere is lots of parking along the street the bar is on
 .\n\nAlso\, please drink responsibly/have a plan to get a ride home if nee
 ded.\n\np.s. they have no burgers...\n\nHope to see you there!
