SUMMARY:DJ Aziz Vora @ Double Crown
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nCome check out Aziz Vora at the 
 popular Double Crown bar in West Asheville. Aziz is the best house DJ I've
  ever seen so prepare to have a good time.\n\nWe have our Class Mob event 
 before so a bunch of us will come dressed up... making us easy to find. To
  join that event too\, RSVP [here](https://www.meetup.com/20s-30s-40s-frie
 ndly-people-do-cool-stuff/events/313144325/?eventOrigin=group_upcoming_eve
 nts).\n\nWe're not 100% when Aziz goes on or ends (likely 12pm to 2pm) but
  it will be a fun time regardless.\n\nHope to see you there!
