SUMMARY:Great Smoky Mountains National Park
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nLet's checkout Great Smoky Mount
 ains National Park!\n\nWe'll meet at the Oconaluftee Visitor's Center\, th
 en spend a few hours hiking a section of the Appalachian Trail.\n\nIt's hi
 gher elevation so I'd definitely recommend bringing a bottle of water.\n\n
 Hope to see you there!
